/11052310/screencap/680a76a5de9ce.jpg","released":"2025-04-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"5. Donde uno pertenece","overview":"Aston se da cuenta de que en realidad Zenos sí era esencial para el grupo y va a buscarlo.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11052311/screencap/68139676be087.jpg","released":"2025-05-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Fin de la aventura","overview":"Zenos se enfrenta al gólem junto a Zophia, Lynga y Loewe y descubrirán qué se esconde en su interior.\r\n\r\nAudio","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11052312/screencap/681cd269da532.jpg","released":"2025-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. Servicio especial","overview":"Zenos va a unos baños termales para descansar. Allí se topará con alguien que lo sacará de entre las sombras.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11052313/screencap/682685363a618.jpg","released":"2025-05-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Hospital Real","overview":"Zenos llega al Hospital Real como alumno especial con la intención de pasar desapercibido. ¿Lo conseguirá?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11052314/screencap/682f56f55923a.jpg","released":"2025-05-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Infiltrado en la facción","overview":"Zenos consigue que lo admitan en la facción de Goldran y empieza a conseguir algo de información.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11052315/screencap/6839b5e31b1ad.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32524709:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. La petición de la dama","overview":"Goldran, Cresson y Zenos van a casa de una d